OL,3,GOrkney
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain and
OL,6,Fsleet showers gradually dying out
OL,7,Fthrough the evening. Overnight will be
OL,8,Flargely dry with some clear spells and
OL,9,Fjust the isolated shower possible.
OL,10,FCold overnight with a frost or icy
OL,11,Fpatches forming. Moderate northerly
OL,12,Fwinds becoming westerly. Minimum
OL,13,FTemperature -1C.
OL,14,
OL,15,CFriday:FMostly dry in the morning with
OL,16,Fsome brightness and just an isolated
OL,17,Fshower possible. Cloudy in the
OL,18,Fafternoon with rain spreading
OL,19,Feastwards. Southwesterly winds
OL,20,Fbecoming strong. Less cold than
OL,21,FThursday. Maximum Temperature 7C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
