OL,3,GOrkney
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA mix
OL,6,Fof sunny spells and showers with some
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain possible.
OL,8,FGenerally light winds but stronger on
OL,9,FMonday. Continuing to feel less cold
OL,10,Fthan recent days.
